@prefix sulo: <https://w3id.org/sulo/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/> .

# One individual typed both sulo:Object and sulo:Process, which
# sulo.ttl declares owl:disjointWith. Merged with real SULO this is
# inconsistent under any sound reasoner, so it is the differential's
# control for "HermiT can see SULO's own axioms", as opposed to
# merely parsing the file.
ex:both a sulo:Object, sulo:Process .
